/*                                                                       */
/* DATA STRUCTURES                                                       */
/*                                                                       */
/*      DM_PCB                              Dynamic Pool control block   */
/*      DM_HEADER                           Header of each memory block  */
/*      DM_SUSPEND                          Memory suspension block      */
/*                                                                       */
/* DEPENDENCIES                                                          */
/*                                                                       */
